      "text": "These agencies are dealing with critical problems in the lives of all of our people - drug addiction, cancer, heart disease, adoption, day care, blindness, hospital care and many, many others. They serve over 1,000,000 of our fellow New Yorkers each year at a total operating cost of over one billion dollars.",
